{"format":"telly-addicts-eps","v":1,"show":"Taz-Mania","i":18425,"eps":[{"s":1,"e":1,"t":"The Dog the Turtle Story","a":"1991-09-07","l":30,"d":"Taz rescues a turtle which acts like a dog from a trap and adopts him as a pet, but then he and him visit his outback family and they all rescue Taz from Bull Gator and Axl.","img":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vkr1jaoHrJ4KxxbKvpP9rRMHYv5.jpg"},{"s":1,"e":2,"t":"Like Father, Like Son","a":"1991-09-14","l":30,"d":"Taz and his dad (hugh) spend some 'quality' time together. After a series of disastrous activities they discover that maybe they are more alike then they think.","img":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9e9d8Q3V0j4akyjPJKHtgP82fcY.jpg"},{"s":1,"e":3,"t":"Frights of Passage","a":"1991-09-14","l":30,"d":"Francis X. Bushlad seeks to capture the Tazmanian Devil as part of his rite to manhood.","img":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ieXBQYJyMMmTKE2nCEE8ONjqXgz.jpg"},{"s":1,"e":4,"t":"War & Pieces","a":"1991-09-21","l":30,"d":"Taz and his little siblings Molly and Jake are left to run the house while their parents visit Grandma.","img":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/apOmQtZWonIyljaT0GrKbb6Bymt.jpg"},{"s":1,"e":5,"t":"Airbourne Airhead","a":"1991-09-21","l":30,"d":"With help from the Platypus Brothers Daniel and Timothy, Taz attempts to climb Pointy Peak and obtain giant bird eggs with which to make a Taz-sized omelet.","img":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sUeBsq8mpoA5jdnxI5nn7E3O70M.jpg"},{"s":1,"e":6,"t":"It's No Picnic","a":"1991-09-28","l":30,"d":"Taz goes to visit the platypus brothers and spots some giant eggs on top of a mountain. Unfortunately the platypus brothers decide to help.","img":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hfv9q9vdxZoyklUHbV8vayRRQiI.jpg"},{"s":1,"e":7,"t":"Kee-Wee ala King","a":"1991-09-28","l":30,"d":"Taz and his best friend, Buddy Boar, compete.","img":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n2JzGFkTYXZSF5hPTyONLNQab4n.jpg"},{"s":1,"e":8,"t":"A Devil of a Job","a":"1991-10-05","l":30,"d":"To earn money to buy a motorcycle, Taz gets a job at Hotel Tazmania.","img":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2o3POgm2Rz4rDyxyQc7Zj06ipYm.jpg"},{"s":1,"e":9,"t":"Battling Bushrats","a":"1991-10-12","l":30,"d":"Taz defends his home, and the family's dinner, from repeated attacks by the Battling Bushrats.","img":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9tM98S0Mz6eexqcvAcYegw32rWo.jpg"},{"s":1,"e":10,"t":"Devil in the Deep Blue Sea","a":"1991-10-12","l":30,"d":"Didgeri Dingo enlists Taz's aid to retrieve undersea treasure, but taz does all the work.","img":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r5XowfjSJ0PSFUyYQGEX5xxR0aK.jpg"},{"s":1,"e":11,"t":"Woeful Wolf","a":"1991-10-19","l":30,"d":"The last lonely Tazmanian Wolf tries to find a family to live with.","img":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7GXTOZbnuai3E5Idp6GO56QuJd2.jpg"},{"s":1,"e":12,"t":"Devil with the Violet Dress On","a":"1991-10-26","l":30,"d":"Taz and his mom spend the day doing fun things together, with disastrous results.","img":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5h6un05CVPEBSNTp8S6f51wHS5S.jpg"},{"s":1,"e":13,"t":"Kidnapped Koala","a":"1991-10-26","l":30,"d":"After Constance is abducted by Bull.","img":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gcOOFTFJ9l5J6bWuE06jTsEQQzP.jpg"},{"s":1,"e":14,"t":"Mishap in the Mist","a":"1991-11-02","l":30,"d":"Anthropologist Jane Allgood decides to study the Tazmanian Devil family.","img":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/95JlVzMQmDacuPjejaBoIjFQN2g.jpg"},{"s":1,"e":15,"t":"Toothache Taz","a":"1991-11-02","l":30,"d":"Taz refuses to see a dentist while suffering a toothache and turns to the Platypus Brothers for help.","img":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4dUJ5pehtzDfcdqwQGW9ESrzg2O.jpg"},{"s":1,"e":16,"t":"Here, Kitty, Kitty, Kitty","a":"1991-11-09","l":30,"d":"Molly gets a cute cat for a pet, who quickly becomes Taz's worst nightmare.","img":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gpsMeqxvABtEiQchTF7lT0hZHVi.jpg"},{"s":1,"e":17,"t":"Enter the Devil","a":"1991-11-09","l":30,"d":"Mr. Thickley trains Taz to be a k